      hu: ["Vietnám harmadik legnagyobb városa és az északi rész fő kikötője.", "A várost nyáron több ezer virágzó vörös flamboyant fa díszíti.", "Itt épült fel a VinFast, az első vietnámi autógyártó komplexuma.", "Az 1904-ben épült Hai Phong-i Operaház a francia építészet remeke.", "A Cat Bi nemzetközi repülőtér fontos légiközlekedési csomópont.", "Történelmi jelentőségű a Du Hang-pagoda, amely több mint 400 éves."],
      ro: ["Este principalul port maritim al Vietnamului de Nord, fondat în 1888.", "Supranumit 'Orașul Flamboyanților Roșii' datorită florei locale.", "Găzduiește cea mai mare fabrică de automobile din Vietnam pe insula Cat Hai.", "Opera din Hai Phong a fost finalizată în 1904 după modelul francez.", "Este poarta de acces către Rezervația Biosferei de pe insula Cat Ba.", "Râul Cam, care traversează orașul, are o lungime de aproximativ 30 km."],
      en: ["Hai Phong is northern Vietnam's most important industrial port city.", "Famed for its red flamboyant trees that bloom across the city in summer.", "Site of the VinFast mega-factory, Vietnam's first indigenous car plant.", "The Hai Phong Opera House was constructed in 1904 with French materials.", "Serves as the main transportation link to Cat Ba Island and Lan Ha Bay.", "The city's deep-water port is among the largest in Southeast Asia."],
